            <h2>Why Ahmedabad logistics is different</h2>
            <p class="sec-sub">Local context, real hubs, real industry mix &mdash; the specifics that shape marketing strategy for Ahmedabad operators.</p>
            <div class="local-intro">
<p>Ahmedabad + Gujarat is India's largest exports state + a fundamentally export-oriented logistics market. <strong>Kandla + Mundra + Pipavav ports</strong> together handle India's second-largest container + break-bulk cargo volume after JNPT + are the primary Western India gateway for chemicals + petroleum + industrial goods + textile + apparel + agri exports. <strong>Mundra Port</strong> specifically is India's largest private port + a critical container gateway.</p><p><strong>Sanand + Bavla + Changodar</strong> are Ahmedabad's auto + electronics manufacturing belt (Tata Motors Nano legacy plant, Ford legacy, Suzuki, Ampro, Bosch). <strong>Surat + Diamond District</strong> is India's diamond cutting + polishing + export capital handling 90%+ of world's cut diamonds. <strong>Vapi + Dahej industrial corridor</strong> handles chemicals + specialty chemicals + pharma bulk. <strong>Ahmedabad International Airport (AMD)</strong> handles growing air cargo including diamond + pharma express air.</p><p>Marketing weights differ: Ahmedabad + Gujarat freight forwarders lean 60% LinkedIn ABM to exporter procurement + trade offices + 20% Google + 15% trade PR + 5% Gujarati + Hindi email nurture. Ahmedabad textile + apparel export freight is a distinct sub-cluster with export-house buyer profile. Diamond + jewellery cross-border requires highly specialised insured + custom-cleared shipping. Gujarati + Hindi + English content matters for local + regional catchment. Ahmedabad SG Highway + Sarkhej corporate + tech corridor emerging as D2C brand + SaaS decision-maker cluster.</p>
            </div>

            <h3 style="text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin:40px 0 20px;">Major logistics hubs + zones</h3>
            <div class="hubs-grid">
                    <div class="hub-card"><h4>Kandla + Mundra + Pipavav Ports</h4><p>India's second-largest port cluster after JNPT. Container + break-bulk + petroleum + chemicals + textiles + agri. Buyer: ocean freight forwarders, customs house agents, CFS + ICD operators, chemical + textile export houses.</p></div>
                    <div class="hub-card"><h4>Sanand + Bavla + Changodar Auto Manufacturing</h4><p>Auto + electronics manufacturing belt. Tata Motors legacy Nano plant, Ford legacy, Suzuki, Ampro, Bosch. Buyer: auto + component supply-chain heads, export freight forwarders, industrial cargo specialists.</p></div>
                    <div class="hub-card"><h4>Surat Diamond + Textile Cluster</h4><p>India's diamond capital (90%+ world cut diamonds) + man-made textile hub. Buyer: diamond + jewellery export houses (highly specialised insured + customs shipping), textile exporters to GCC + Africa + USA.</p></div>
                    <div class="hub-card"><h4>Vapi + Dahej Chemical Corridor</h4><p>Chemicals + specialty chemicals + pharma bulk export corridor. Hazmat + specialised handling. Buyer: chemical export houses, pharma bulk manufacturers, industrial cargo specialists.</p></div>
                    <div class="hub-card"><h4>Ahmedabad International Airport (AMD)</h4><p>Growing air cargo including diamond + pharma express. Buyer: high-value air freight forwarders, diamond + jewellery secure air shipping, pharma bulk air freight.</p></div>
                    <div class="hub-card"><h4>SG Highway + Sarkhej Corporate + Emerging D2C</h4><p>Ahmedabad corporate + tech + emerging D2C brand cluster. Buyer: corporate couriers, growing D2C founder cluster, integration-focused 3PL evaluators.</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
