            <p class="sec-sub">Marketing angles + content topics + channel weights are shaped by the industries you serve locally.</p>
            <div class="grid-3">
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-tshirt"></i></div><h3>Textile + Apparel Export</h3><p>Ahmedabad + Surat textile + apparel export corridor. Cotton + synthetic textile + garment exports to GCC + Africa + USA + EU. Ocean freight + growing air freight. Large B2B buyer pool.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-diamond"></i></div><h3>Diamond + Jewellery Export</h3><p>Surat diamond capital + Ahmedabad + Rajkot jewellery. 90%+ world cut + polished diamonds. Highly specialised insured + secure + customs-cleared air freight to Belgium + Israel + USA + Hong Kong.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i></div><h3>Chemicals + Specialty Chemicals</h3><p>Vapi + Dahej + Ankleshwar chemical corridor. Hazmat + specialised handling. Ocean + air freight to GCC + EU + USA + China + Southeast Asia. Regulatory + compliance-heavy.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-pills"></i></div><h3>Pharma + API Manufacturing</h3><p>Gujarat pharma cluster (Zydus Cadila, Cadila Healthcare, Torrent). Bulk API + finished formulation exports. Regulated + Schedule H + cold-chain-adjacent for select shipments.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-car"></i></div><h3>Auto + Auto Components</h3><p>Sanand + Bavla auto manufacturing. Auto + component exports to GCC + Africa + LATAM + EU. Ocean + Ro-Ro + air freight. Growing India-to-Africa auto ecosystem.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-leaf"></i></div><h3>Agri + Food Export</h3><p>Gujarat groundnut + cotton + castor + spice + cumin exports. Ocean freight to GCC + Southeast Asia + EU. Ambient + select cold-chain for perishables.</p></div>
