                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></div><h3>LinkedIn ABM: Gujarat exporter TAL</h3><p>150-300 named accounts across Gujarat exporters &mdash; textile (Arvind, Welspun, Vardhman, Aditya Birla Fashion sourcing offices), diamond + jewellery export houses, chemical (Deepak Nitrite, GNFC, GHCL), pharma (Zydus, Torrent, Cadila). Sales Nav + InMail cadence 6-8 touches.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-diamond"></i></div><h3>Diamond + jewellery secure logistics content</h3><p>Highly specialised content on secure diamond + jewellery cross-border shipping, Kimberley Process compliance, insurance + risk framing, Belgium + Israel + USA + Hong Kong customs clearance. Small but high-margin buyer pool + word-of-mouth compounding.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-language"></i></div><h3>Gujarati + Hindi + English creative</h3><p>Gujarati creative for local + regional catchment (Ahmedabad + Vadodara + Rajkot + Surat). Hindi for wider North + West India. English for enterprise B2B. Trilingual creative outperforms single-language by 25-40% on local + regional.</p></div>
