            <div class="faq-item"><h3 class="faq-q">What makes Ahmedabad different from Mumbai for freight forwarding marketing?</h3><div class="faq-a">Ahmedabad is textile + diamond + chemical + auto export dominant. Mumbai is FMCG + apparel + D2C + Bhiwandi 3PL dominant. Ahmedabad buyers are export-house procurement + trade offices; Mumbai buyers are D2C brand ops + apparel export houses. Ahmedabad + Gujarat is a purer B2B export market; Mumbai is mixed B2B + D2C fulfilment.</div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><h3 class="faq-q">Should we produce Gujarati creative for Ahmedabad marketing?</h3><div class="faq-a">Yes materially for local + Gujarat regional catchment. Gujarati creative outperforms English-only by 25-40% on cost + engagement for local courier + regional 3PL + industrial supply-chain. Not needed for enterprise textile + diamond + chemical B2B (English + occasionally Hindi).</div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><h3 class="faq-q">What is the diamond + jewellery cross-border marketing opportunity from Surat?</h3><div class="faq-a">Highly specialised + small-buyer-pool but high-margin. Marketing content on secure diamond shipping, Kimberley Process compliance, Belgium + Israel + USA + Hong Kong customs clearance, and insurance + risk framing builds authority in an under-served content niche. Word-of-mouth in the tight diamond community amplifies well-published category thought leadership disproportionately.</div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><h3 class="faq-q">How do Ahmedabad chemical export forwarders market hazmat specialisation?</h3><div class="faq-a">IMDG + IATA hazmat + DGR-certified handling content library. Whitepapers on hazmat classification (UN numbers, class assignments), packing group requirements, DG shipping documentation, and international chemical regulations (REACH for EU, TSCA for USA). Specialist LinkedIn ABM to Vapi + Dahej + Ankleshwar chemical export houses.</div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><h3 class="faq-q">What is a realistic marketing budget for an Ahmedabad-based freight forwarder?</h3><div class="faq-a">Rs 3-8 lakh / month for mid-market (Rs 25-200 Cr rev) focused on Kandla / Mundra / Pipavav + Gujarat industrial catchment. Heavy on LinkedIn ABM (Gujarat exporter TAL), route SEO (Ahmedabad-origin ocean freight), trade PR (Cargo Talk + Maritime Gateway + Gujarati business publications), and industry event sponsorships (Gujarat Global Summit, Vibrant Gujarat).</div></div>
